  "description": "After the junior she had a crush on dies in an unexpected accident, Sarang adopts and raises their child, Yeongwon. \n\nShe raises Yeongwon with unwavering love and devotion, accepting her completely. And Yeongwon, misunderstanding Sarang's affection, declares war on her, promising to date her on her 20th birthday.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n [Bomtoon](https://bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/forever_hm), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/forever_hm)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/forever_hm)",
